1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,950
…Board vote?

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,950
It's my dad's. Family business thing.
He makes me vote on stuff.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,450
Your dad has a lot of departments.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:12,950
He really does.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,950
Forty-five.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,950
You two the Groupon booking? Boats
seven and eight.

7
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,950
Oh, you're dead.

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,700
What's the dumbest thing you ever
spent money on?

9
00:00:43,750 --> 00:00:44,950
Uh— you first.

10
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:49,950
Four hundred bucks on a concert I left
after three songs. You?

11
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:56,617
…I bought a whole set of pans once.
Never took 'em out of the plastic.

12
00:00:56,667 --> 00:00:57,950
That's so sad.

13
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:59,950
I opened them. Recently.

14
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:04,950
The postcard on your desk. Lisbon?

15
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,150
I have a jar. Like, a literal jar.

16
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:08,950
Why Lisbon?

17
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:12,950
My abuela always talked about it. My
dad kept promising.

18
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:14,950
Never got to go.

19
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,950
What if somebody just… covered it?

20
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,950
Then it'd be their trip.

21
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:23,950
I want it to be mine.

22
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:44,950
Hunter Cole. In a rental kayak. Does
your board know?
